{
  "sourceLanguage" : "cs",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ · %@" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%lld Kč" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld Kč"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jak nákup funguje" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How buying works"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lístek koupíte odesláním předvyplněné SMS. Platbu vyúčtuje váš mobilní operátor, neplatíte přes App Store." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You buy a ticket by sending a pre-filled SMS. Your mobile operator bills it — nothing goes through the App Store."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lístky se kupují prémiovou SMS. Ze zahraniční SIM v roamingu nedorazí." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tickets are bought by premium SMS. They never arrive on a foreign SIM in roaming."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nákup vyžaduje SIM kartu českého operátora" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buying requires a Czech operator's SIM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Placení SMS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paying by SMS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Potřebujete českou SIM kartu" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You need a Czech SIM card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prémiové SMS umí zpracovat jen čeští operátoři (O2, T‑Mobile, Vodafone a jejich virtuální sítě). Předplacená karta stačí." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only Czech operators can process premium SMS (O2, T‑Mobile, Vodafone and the networks running on them). A prepaid card is enough."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SMS se nepodařilo odeslat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The SMS couldn't be sent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SMS se obvykle tváří, že odešla, ale lístek nedorazí. Appka se to nemá jak dozvědět — iOS jí nedovolí číst příchozí SMS — proto raději upozorňujeme dopředu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The message usually looks like it was sent, but no ticket arrives. The app has no way of knowing — iOS won't let it read incoming SMS — so we would rather tell you up front."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Více" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "More"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Více informací" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Learn more"
